1 2 [c] - A Virologist has authenticated themselves within iTrust2. UC2
2 3 [s] hcp A Virologist, a type HCP, uploads a list of passenger data . The Virologist can view the R0 value of the COVID-19 outbreak on the Analytics page associated with UC28, calculated from the uploaded passenger data . A classification for the outbreak will be displayed based off the actual R0 value . An error message will be displayed if a list of passenger data has not yet been uploaded .
3 4 [e] system displays a success message and logs transaction
4 5 [c] System processes request successfully and logs transaction.
